%% frame: UC1 basic flow B6 to B9 with A5: view one product (analysis)
sequenceDiagram
    actor Visitor
    participant UI as CatalogUI (boundary)
    participant Ctl as BrowseListingsControl (control)
    participant Prod as Product (entity)
    participant Team as Team (entity)

    Visitor->>UI: B6: open(product)
    UI->>Ctl: B6: viewListing(product)
    Ctl->>Prod: B7: isOnSale()
    Prod-->>Ctl: on sale, or not
    break missing, draft or delisted (A5)
        Ctl->>UI: A5: showNotFound()
        UI-->>Visitor: not-found card
    end
    Ctl->>Team: B8: bestOpenFor(product)
    Team-->>Ctl: best open team, or none
    Ctl->>Prod: B8: priceFor(team)
    Prod-->>Ctl: individual price, team price or none
    Ctl->>UI: B9: showListing(detail)
    UI-->>Visitor: detail page; start or join needs sign-in (UC2)
